# REPLACED (BR wave 1.6 N2): production configuration is split into two files so api and
# worker never receive database admin credentials.
#
#   app.env.example       -> copy to .env.app       (api, worker, compose interpolation)
#   db-admin.env.example  -> copy to .env.db-admin  (db service, db-roles and migrate jobs)
#
#   cp app.env.example .env.app && cp db-admin.env.example .env.db-admin && chmod 600 .env.app .env.db-admin
#
# See docs/ops/UZ_HOSTING_RUNBOOK.md §3. Do not add settings here.
